    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi again,<div><br></div><div>I just caught up with this thread and think I learned my answer: <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!category-topic/stan-users/rstanarm/gwaEpERn1Io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!category-topic/stan-users/rstanarm/gwaEpERn1Io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458551068000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dhvcOvRJMSitb0zOAMplp\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!category-topic/stan-users/rstanarm/gwaEpERn1Io</a></div><div><br></div><div>It looks like it works if I run</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">dfXY </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">Y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>stan_polr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Y ~ .&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dfXY</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> prior </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> prior_counts </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dirichlet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1012</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div>So consider my problem resolved, but perhaps this will be useful to other users who encounter the problem.</div><div><br></div><div>~Nathan</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
