r as follows:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">stan_polr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Y ~ X&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> prior </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> prior_counts </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dirichlet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1012</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>Is there anything I can do to resolve or workaround this error?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for any advice!</div><div><br></div><div>~Nathan</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
